			Topic: STAT FOOD!!!! &nbsp;(Read 484 times)
		</td>
	</tr>
</table>
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=3" title="View the profile of EQSysquella">EQSysquella</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								GO GO NERFED DPS<br />
								Guild Officer<br />
								Veeshan<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 1261<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.fotguild.com/vb3/image.php?u=27&amp;dateline=1085023518" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Grem&#039;s Parole Officer<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<a href="aim:goim?screenname=EQSysquella&amp;message=Hi.+Are+you+there?"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/aim.gif" alt="EQSysquella" border="0" /></a><br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=3"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.pitbosscchc.com/" title="Official Pitboss Website" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:JusPlay77@hotmail.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=61.msg165#msg165"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=61.msg165#msg165">STAT FOOD!!!!</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> April 06, 2003, 10:41:40 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Ok.. before I start.. think about this ;).. I gain about 150hp from my stat food.. now while you are saying &quot;wow, stat food isnt that bad... but dman its hell-a-expensive&quot;..<br /><br />Now I would assume 50/50 know how stat food works (this is based on my experience, and how many times ive had to explain it).. so I will write it up for all to see.. =D<br /><br />You obtain stats from the uber foods when it is placed in your first eating slot.. (notice I didnt say you had to eat it).. god only knows how many times I force fed to see fi stats added when this first came out)..<br /><br />Well while I was baffled I had figured out how this all worked.. Anyways, back to what I was saying.. <br /><br />If you have 1 Tormentor Stir Fry, and 1 Grobb Liquidised Meat, it can last you FOREVER!!!!! (yes forever).. and no I dont mean jus get innate metabolism 3 (although it DOES help, and I do have it now.. and after thinking it was useless for so long).. &nbsp;<br /><br />Instructions:<br /><br />(1) Place Stat food in 1st eating slot<br />(2) Place Stat drink in 2nd eatting slot<br />(3) Carry 1-3 stacks of crap food (patty melts, iron rations, etc.. the longer lasting the better really)<br />(4) Likewise for drink (I recommend Formula 5000.. works great and its hella-cheap)<br /><br />If you are using a bag for food- place food in top left.. and drink in top right).. with the crap food directly below food, and likewise with drink<br /><br />Force Feeding yourself with your crap food until full will keep you from eating/drinking your expensive treats.. and as long as you have it in first slot.. you keep the stats.. (forever)..<br /><br />now, every once in awhile you may forget and poof.. your food will be gone.. (best to place crap food/drink above your stat food if you are doing long boring farms, or just chatting so you dont forget)..<br /><br />Lastly.. you ask &quot;why worry about force feed.. I can always buy more stat food..&quot;<br /><br />Well when Tormentor&#039;s Stir fry is 400p each.. and Hero Sandwhiches are 150p each.. its best to save the money you can.. <br /><br />Btw stats on those:<br /><br />Hero Sandwhich(trivial &gt;250):<br />miraculous meal<br />STR 10, DEX 5, STA 5, WIS 5, INT 5, AGI 5, HP 30, mana 30<br />wt 1.0, small<br /><br />Tormentor&#039;s Stir Fry(trivial &gt;250)<br />miraculous meal<br />DEX 8, AGI 8, STA 8, HP 50<br />wt 2.0, large.<br /><br />Grobb Liquidised Drink(Trivial 216)<br />miraculous drink<br />STR 6, STA 6, WIS -1, INT -1, wt 0.1, <br />small<br /><br />There are a lot more stat foods.. but I personally use tormentors+grobb (and hero sandwhiches on my caster twinks)..<br /><br />I sell both btw (and farm hoh/torment regularly to make more).. <br /><br />that &nbsp;is all for now.. ;)<br /><br />EDIT: <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?board=3;action=display;threadid=62" target="_blank">Selling here</a>
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: April 14, 2003, 08:06:08 am by EQSysquella</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><div align="center"><br /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=586624" target="_blank"> <img src="http://www.fotguild.com/images/09.20.04/sys_sig6.jpg" alt="" border="0" /></a><br /><br />L70 Lord<br />Officer of Fires of Time<br /></div>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg191"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=7" title="View the profile of Meleane">Meleane</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Guild Officer<br />
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Female.gif" alt="Female" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 29<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/kof4.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								rainja !!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=7"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=61.msg191#msg191"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=61.msg191#msg191">Re:STAT FOOD!!!!</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #1 on:</b> April 07, 2003, 09:21:29 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Being a ranger, I just force feed what I forage. What I personnaly use :<br /><br />Justice Fruit Pies<br />DEX: +15 &nbsp;STA: +5 &nbsp;WIS: +5 &nbsp;HP: +15 &nbsp;<br />MANA: +15 &nbsp;<br /><br /><br />Qeynos Afternoon Tea<br />DEX: +5 &nbsp;WIS: +5 &nbsp;INT: +5 &nbsp;AGI: +5 &nbsp;<br /><br />OR<br /><br />Kaladim Constitutional<br />STA: +5 &nbsp;SV FIRE: +5 &nbsp;SV DISEASE: +5 &nbsp;SV COLD: +5 &nbsp;<br />SV MAGIC: +5 &nbsp;SV POISON: +5
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=552082" target="_blank"><img src="http://pages.infinit.net/zolia/Sig.jpg" alt="" border="0" /></a>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg257"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=10" title="View the profile of Trevurg">Trevurg</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 14<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.guscave.com/avatars/atarujsy.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Nicely inconspicuous<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=10"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=61.msg257#msg257"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=61.msg257#msg257">Re:STAT FOOD!!!!</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2 on:</b> April 08, 2003, 02:33:02 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I'm lazy <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /> &nbsp;I fill a bag with Halas 10 Lb Meat Pies and Grobb Drink. &nbsp;Eventually it runs out and I buy more. &nbsp;Great stuff, and reasonably inexpensive, can usually find both for 100pp-120pp a stack - and a stack lasts forever.<br /><br />When I'm doing tradeskills I pull out some Misty Thicket Picnics / Qeynos Tea. &nbsp;<br /><br />If I could ever remember to force feed, I'd be stocking up on that stir fry, tho. &nbsp;When I've tried in the past, I invariably remember to force feed just after I've eaten something expensive, and of course you're too full to eat just then.<br /><br />Need a &quot;hunger meter&quot; in the UI... yeah.<br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg277"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=3" title="View the profile of EQSysquella">EQSysquella</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								GO GO NERFED DPS<br />
								Guild Officer<br />
