							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							For normal situtations I use Halas Meat Pies and Qeynos Afternoon Tea. If I need an extra boost on Saves for a raid, which I usually do since my resists suck, I use Kaladum Constitutional and Holy Cakes...adding a total of +10 to all resists I believe. And yes, I force feed because I'm cheap and dont want to buy these items again <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" />
